    "把你的明确判断变成下次更清楚的排序，而不是擅自替你做决定。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Turn your explicit choices into clearer future ordering, never decisions made for you." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "把你的明確判斷變成下次更清楚的排序，而不是擅自替你做決定。" } } } },
