    "总览" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Overview" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "總覽" } } } },
    "先看清空间去了哪里，再决定要不要处理。所有分析都在本机完成。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "See where your storage went before deciding what to do. Analysis stays on this Mac." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "先看清空間去了哪裡，再決定要不要處理。所有分析都在本機完成。" } } } },
